{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上經文，如來以教為手，眾生以信為手。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如為一人，應云：是故我今勸汝，令於三寶生信。汝今能發\n淨信心否？能者答言：能。次語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵云鄔婆素迦，唐言近事男；梵云鄔婆斯迦，唐云近事女，親近承事佛法僧故。舊云\n優婆塞，此云清信男等，謂能起清淨信心故也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說。復語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或唯\n男唯女隨稱，若一人須除等字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "應語彼云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能者答能。復語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上論文，魔則他化天主，統攝欲界\n五趣。入欲捨邪，須歸三寶。仗三寶力，出魔境界。若起一念邪心，即出三寶境界。若〔起〕一支戒，即違三寶言教。三\n寶雖悲，則不救護。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說，敬禮三寶。禮已語云：此是三歸，更有三竟，汝一心受。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說已，敬禮常住三寶。此三歸詞句，依最勝無比經。如來\n已下，古來准十戒三歸，義加此語。既是翻邪，理應語云：更不歸餘邪魔外道等。次應語云：也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼答云：是。復應語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自下問答，依優婆塞經。應云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼答言：能。以外道執自在天，為佛立像供養。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼答云：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云：能。復應讚云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "准最勝無比經，若人供養三千世界滿中諸佛，如稻麻等，滿三萬歲，所獲福德，比前歸依，百千萬分不及\n\n一。又准經說，三歸各有三善神守護也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "應語彼云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說，敬禮常住三寶。復語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "復更語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼答云：知。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼答云：歡喜。師應語\n云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師應語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若是女語云：若出家已，則須受沙彌尼十戒。年至十八，則\n須受式叉六法。滿廿，則須受尼大戒。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上經文。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼答云：能。復語云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "問云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "被答云：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答：能。已上五問，廣略隨時也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師應語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "敬禮三拜，䠒跪請云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說。准佛阿毗曇十戒，又例彼請也。師應答云：可爾。\n復應語彼云〔也〕："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是語已，方與受云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是\n三說。遍遍皆須分折告示。又應語云：此三歸三遍了，更三竟，三遍在，汝可一心須受。語已教云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說，亦須遍遍警䇿，分折告示。說兩遍了，語云：更一遍在，正是得戒時，汝等一心承受。說第三遍了，\n語云：汝已得戒。此三歸詞句，亦依最勝無比經。我受已下，依俱舍論云：自稱我是鄔婆素迦，願尊憶持，慈悲護\n念。爾時便發五戒律儀。已上論文，要加此語，方乃得戒，陳翻邪故。師復語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼答云：知。師復問云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼答云：歡喜。師應語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "准最無比經，受五戒功德，比前受三歸，次十善，次八戒，所獲功德，百分、千\n分、萬分、億分，乃至鄔波尼殺曇分，不及其一。又准經，五戒各有五神護。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師應語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "語已，說云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此總標勑聽，准律中具戒文。若善女人，或眾同受，離合隨時。自下別列，及結准\n律中受十戒文。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答言：能。言邪者，總有五義：一、非境，是他妻妾。二、非道，設是己妻口及餘道。三、非時，乳\n兒時、受齋時、懷胎時。四、非處，佛像、殿塔、伽藍及露處。五、非量，一夜不過五度。復須避三明、六暗。三明者，日、月、灯、\n火；暗者，即六齋夜也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答言：能。總結云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師應語云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此結勸詞句。梵網經及四分律，隨義安立也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "故維摩經云：富有七財寶，教授以資自。加行所說，修行回向為大利。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法事次第八門准前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上經文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上論文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能者答言：能〔。師〕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上論文。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼答云：好。又應問云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云：欲受。\n師應間云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "軌則如前五戒中說，但末後結云：弟子今日捨邪歸正，懺洗罪𠎝，求受"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師應語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "詞句問答等，如前五戒文\n說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "詞句亦如前說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師應語云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵曰鄔〔波\n婆娑〕，唐云近住"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上論文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上於文若一一廣說，持破果報，恐此文繁，復當別說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼答歡喜。\n師語復云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼應答能。師應語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第五明了。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師應語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誡已授云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說，遍遍皆須警䇿。師應語云：此是三歸，更有三竟，即便得戒，汝一心受也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是三說，亦遍遍警䇿。說兩遍已，語云：此第三遍，正發戒時，汝一心領受。說已語云：汝已得戒了。復應語\n云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云：知。又問云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云：歡喜。復師語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師應語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "告已，語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答能。象牙、玳琩、帖鏤\n等牀，九尺一丈高廣之者，此皆長慢增憍，判之不許上。師僧父母所居之床座，縱使狹小，亦不得上。以是尊人\n所不合〔陞〕座故也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云能。若依有宗，前塗佩哥觀，合為第六，高床第七，過中第八。此一是齋，亦是齋支。餘七是支而非齋。依法密\n部，六七不合，都有九事。則前八是戒，後一是齋。今依法密，以同十戒，故次結云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法式同前上來八戒了。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "善惡因果，義數而立也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若與受五戒者，借此語用，\n亦得應云：關五惡門，關五善戶，得五神通，永超五趣。五惡者何？當次第為說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "依長爪梵志經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "女人隨稱。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若一人云：汝是凡夫。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云：能。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上經文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云：能。復語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "詞句可知。啟請已，准佛藏經，次〔信〕應受四不壞信。應云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "授云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說已，復云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼答云：能。次復語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "悔詞可知。次復語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上經文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼應答云：能。又應語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "攝律儀戒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "攝善法戒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "攝眾生戒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "女人亦說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂布施等六方\n便力回󰬇。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "被答云：能。又應語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼答云：能。次復語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次總結云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "准此即是出家菩薩有德行者，\n\n不簡凡聖，先請和上，次請闍梨。闍梨牒和上名，入羯磨中受與彼戒。若准普賢觀經，令請本師釋迦牟尼佛為\n和上，文殊菩薩為羯磨阿闍梨，彌勒菩薩為教授阿闍梨，十方諸佛為證戒師，十方菩薩為同學伴侶。時人共\n行，詞句可知。今不依之。所以者何？以彼普賢觀經是自誓受戒，此是從師授，與彼有異。故梵網經云：若千里內\n無能受戒師，得佛菩薩形像前自誓受戒。次復應語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "應持者等教請，請法如上。唯此教又准請一師，此即親發戒師，亦不言請佛。請師語\n云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "問云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若言無有，次應語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若一\n人除等盡二字，彼應答云能。次復語云〔：也〕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "教云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "俗人稱弟子，若出家稱比丘等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說已，次語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上經文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼皆應答云能。次復語云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "問云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼答云是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答已發。次語云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼答云：能。次依彌勒羯磨，正與授戒，應云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是至三，每遍皆須令彼諦聽。次依彌勒羯磨，啟告佛菩薩，與\n作證明，云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是至三，次應示相，云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上勑聽總舉，准義加也。下即依瓔珞經下卷云：佛告汝。經無汝字，義加。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "准梵網經\n應云：一切有命者，不得故殺也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼答云：能。餘亦爾。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一一如初。次結云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼答云：能。次復語云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼答云：能。次勸修云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如常可知。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出像法決\n疑經。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T29n1562_p0578c13"}
{"id": null, "n": "0361002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0361002", "type": "mod", "text": "陞【CB】，陛【卍續】，陛疑陞"}
{"id": null, "n": "0357001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0357001", "type": "orig", "text": "是疑佛"}
{"id": null, "n": "0358001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0358001", "type": "orig", "text": "起疑犯"}
{"id": null, "n": "0358002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0358002", "type": "orig", "text": "示字更勘或爾字歟"}
{"id": null, "n": "0358003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0358003", "type": "orig", "text": "我下疑脫問字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0359001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0359001", "type": "orig", "text": "求疑永"}
{"id": null, "n": "0359002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0359002", "type": "orig", "text": "就字疑剩"}
{"id": null, "n": "0359003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0359003", "type": "orig", "text": "也字疑衍"}
{"id": null, "n": "0360001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0360001", "type": "orig", "text": "師下應有云字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0360002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0360002", "type": "orig", "text": "忉字更勘"}
